      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ancient_Oaks%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The original subdivision, begun in 1961, was the first dense middle‑class housing development in the Lehigh Valley.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6,
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ancient_Oaks%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Ancient Oaks sits at 40°32′9″N 75°35′24″W, northwest of Lower Macungie Township’s center.",
